Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 2229
Function: libxml_name
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: cur is obtained via PyxmlNode_Get(obj) and used immediately (cur->type) without verifying cur != NULL. If an invalid Python object (e.g., None or wrong type) is passed and PyxmlNode_Get returns NULL, this dereferences a NULL pointer.

